  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rohingya Response and National Resilience Programme (RRNRP) - Closed</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide a comprehensive set of activities which will be executed through a complementing and integrated approach using protection mechanisms, improve basic rights, access to legal assistance, housing, land, and property (HLP) and access to essential services such as education, health care and tailored assistance to people with disabilities in the camps and host communities. Moreover, the project will produce protection monitoring reports on quarterly basis. The protection monitoring reports will be used to inform program interventions implemented by consortium members, identify protection risks and trends over the camps and host community through collecting evidence-based information, and inform advocacy-based intervention.</narrative>
  </description>
